'''Kingdra ex''' (Japanese: '''キングドラex''' ''Kingdra ex'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 2 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

